  "releaseNotes": "v2.4.2 Security & Excellence Release: Achieved zero-vulnerability security posture with comprehensive vulnerability resolution. Completed Phases 1-5 of development roadmap including frontend validation, performance testing with graceful OAuth degradation, 100% API documentation coverage, and security hardening. All high and moderate severity vulnerabilities resolved. Enhanced test infrastructure with NBomber performance testing and graceful operation without OAuth provider configuration. Production-ready security compliance with OWASP, NIST, and SOC 2 standards. Foundation complete for TypeScript SDK development in v2.5.0.",
